        "name": "Shurima's Legacy",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Azir can summon the Disc of the Sun from the ruins of allied or enemy turrets.",
        "bodyHtml": "Azir can summon the <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Sun Disc</span> from the rubble of a turret. The <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Sun Disc</span> deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">((230 ~ 410) + ([[si:scaleap]]40% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and has (30 ~ 90) <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">Armor</span> and <span>Magic Resist</span> but disintegrates over 45 seconds.",
