        "name": "Conquering Sands",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Azir sends all Sand Soldiers towards a location. Sand Soldiers deal magic damage to enemies they pass through and apply a slow for 1 second.",
        "bodyHtml": "Azir orders all <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Sand Soldiers</span> to an area, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(75/95/115/135/155 + ([[si:scaleap]]35/40/45/50/55% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to enemies they pass through and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> them by 25% for 1 second.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Enemies hit by multiple <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Sand Soldiers</span> will not take additional damage.</span>",
