      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "AzirW",
        "name": "Arise!",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Azir summons a Sand Soldier to attack nearby targets for him, replacing his basic attack against targets within the soldier's range. Their attacks deal magic damage to enemies in a line.",
        "bodyHtml": "Azir summons a <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Sand Soldier</span> for 10 seconds. When Azir Attacks an enemy near a <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Sand Soldier</span>, he instead orders the soldiers to stab, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(50/65/80/95/110 + (0 ~ 72) + ([[si:scaleap]]35/42.5/50/57.5/65% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> in their direction.<br /><br />This Ability has 2 charges.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\"><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Sand Soldiers</span> apply On-hits at 50% damage once per attack to Azir's primary target.<br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Sand Soldiers</span> that strike the same targets deal 25% damage after the first.<br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Sand Soldiers</span> deal (20% ~ 100%)damage to enemies that are not Azir's Attack target.<br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Sand Soldiers</span> expire twice as fast when near an enemy turret.<br /></span>",
